This is an UNRELEASED packaging candidate, not an archive upload.

Maintainer correspondence uses the owner-confirmed public address
84wholes_nozzle@icloud.com. The alias must remain reachable for review and
ongoing package bug reports.

The source version identifies upstream commit 3169048. The source archive is
made with git archive from that exact upstream revision; debian/ is a separate
packaging layer. No release tag or upstream release is created by packaging.

The Debian patch series adds GNOME Shell 51 compatibility to the GNOME 46
upstream extension. Package dependencies allow only those two tested major
versions; 47-50 and future releases are not claimed. Native extension checks
must pass on both 46 and 51 before upload. The current project-hosted APT
package remains the unchanged upstream build.

Newer GTK/libadwaita headers deprecate APIs still supported at runtime. Debian
builds keep those diagnostics as warnings; other upstream -Werror checks stay
enabled. This does not suppress the deprecation messages or claim an API port.

The application currently vendors yyjson 0.13.0. Its license is covered by
copyright. Discuss using the Debian system library with the sponsor before
submission; the existing upstream build uses the bundled copy.

Build in a disposable Ubuntu 24.04 environment:
  apt-get build-dep .
  dpkg-buildpackage --no-sign -b
  lintian ../lemonvox_*.changes

The GNOME extension schema is installed in the system GLib schema directory;
dh_installgsettings arranges cache refresh on install and removal. The extension-local schemas directory is omitted so GNOME uses the system
schema source. Never ship a precompiled schema cache from the source checkout.
